# Frontend

- Preserve established visual language; no generic AI purple/cream defaults when redesigning.
- Hero/landing: one composition, brand-first, full-bleed imagery when promotional.
- Prefer existing motion libraries already in package.json (GSAP, motion, three).
- Ensure desktop and mobile both work.
